{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇────！爱理、完蛋了啦────！”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "sn1422", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，叫得这么大声。新吾又去闻美羽的屁股了吗？”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "ar4428", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜呜呜呜呜……”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "sn1423", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我只是开玩笑，居然说中了啊。”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "ar4429", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管是考试期间还是结束后，社团教室都依然热闹。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪又因为猫咪们的行为忽喜忽忧了吗？", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果它们真的交配了，不知道她会怎么样……", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉接美羽回家之后，新吾就变冷淡了。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "sn1424", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前明明很黏我的，现在却都跟美羽一起睡……”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "sn1425", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为它们都是猫，这也是没办法的吧？比起人类当然比较亲同类……”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 266, "voice": "ar4430", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然是那样没错……唉。”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 268, "voice": "sn1426", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那边的气氛好像很忧郁欸。”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0652", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说怎么了，隼太？你会来社团还真稀奇……”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然是因为你，我在担心你啊。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0653", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“担心我？”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那之后怎么样了，有进展吗？”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0654", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么一脸自信满满的表情？该不会你……已经爬上大人的阶梯了？”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0655", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要耍帅，快说啦！明明昨天还一副要去远方旅行的眼神。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0656", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太夹住我的脖子，用拳头对着我的脑袋旋转攻击。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你一直陪我商量。”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好啦好啦，以后也要听我商量喔。”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0657", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？隼太也有烦恼吗？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然有啊。多得跟星星一样、跟大气中漂浮的灰尘一样。”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0658", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久后，就轮到他去遥远国度旅行了吧。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总而言之，恭喜。”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0659", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你以为我会这么单纯祝福你吗？可恶！只有你先爬上大人的阶梯！”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0660", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在阶梯上，有一个你不知道的广大世界喔。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哇，真的烦死了！给我摔下来！给我从阶梯上摔下来！”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 275, "voice": "ht0661", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵～？小熊喵～～？”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1766", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，学姐？”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……新吾君，你有看到小熊喵吗？”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1767", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，今天还没有看见它呢。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……跑到哪里去了呢。平常明明只要叫它的名字就会出现的……”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1768", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐看着新做好的尾巴饰品，很寂寞地垂着肩膀。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一定是去哪里散步了吧。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是那样的话就好了……但是之前妈妈也说过吧？因为是很稀有的动物，差点被抓走……”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1769", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说的也是。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然相处得太习惯都忘了，但熊喵本来并不是能在这里看见的动物。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "它应该是生活在森林深处的动物才对。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1770", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵没问题的。它看起来那样，其实很聪明的。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，你说的没错……”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1771", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在社团等一下吧？”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾君时间没问题吗？”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1772", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了学姐，就算有问题我也会挤出时间。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～那样逞强不好啦～”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，牵手不太好是吧。或许还有谁留下来……”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这几天，必须要跟大家说了呢。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要说出来吗？应该隐瞒会比较好……”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟不可能一直瞒下去，而且……”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我还是希望我们两个人能被大家祝福……”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，我也这么想。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很高兴。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐决定将我们的关系告诉大家。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是想向谁炫耀。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是在与学姐度过的短暂学校生活中，如果在意周围的眼光没办法相处的话会很寂寞的。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我绝对会让学姐幸福的。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也会让新吾君幸福的喔！”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我现在就很幸福了说。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要比现在更幸福嘛！”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 270, "voice": "mu1779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我也要让学姐更加更加幸福。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 265, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们牵着手，像小孩子一样拌嘴。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我毫不怀疑与学姐的幸福未来。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──被大家祝福的两个人……", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能实现就好了呢。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了能实现，我会与学姐一起走下去。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
